[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m matter: pristine, mutated, negative-valued, and values large enough that the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `& 0xFFF` mask and the `int` accumulator behave differently.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
